[01:35.081]Let the kite fly
[01:43.194]Let fate turn
[01:50.417]Let the speechless begin to speak
[02:05.811]The word love has been chewed to naught
[02:09.044]Flavorless in the mouth
[02:12.923]Yet another great famine arrives
[02:36.515]The sheep are still bleating
[02:39.700]The butcher still sharpening his blade
[02:43.634]The flowers in the land, they bloom and fade
[02:59.181]Let the crowds gather
[03:02.752]Let the toiling roiling people
[03:08.518]No longer play the wheels of power
[04:35.364]We’ve crumbled
[04:39.071]Religions of clay in our fingers
[04:42.598]We live in
[04:46.532]Flirtatious churches
[04:48.828]Glamorous temples
[04:50.941]
[04:51.771]Rocking, swaying dangerously
[04:54.234]I don’t know if it’s me or the world
[04:57.906]It’s like the speed of sinking
[05:01.896]Letting off steam
[05:09.350]